OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with heavy rain in the   
OL,6,Fwest at first, rain soon easing and    
OL,7,Fbecoming dry through the afternoon.    
OL,8,FThe east will be cloudy and mostly dry 
OL,9,Fwith just the odd light shower         
OL,10,Fpossible near the coast.               
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly dry night with some  
OL,13,Fclear spells developing, leading to a  
OL,14,Fcold and frosty night for many.        
OL,15,FCloudier with a few showers near the   
OL,16,Feast coast, less cold here.            
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
