OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CThursday:FA mostly dry day with some   
OL,6,Fbright intervals and the odd shower    
OL,7,Fpossible near the east coast. Rain     
OL,8,Fspreading into the west in the         
OL,9,Fevening. Winds strengthening,          
OL,10,Fespecially in west.                    
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy   
OL,13,Fwith strong winds and rain spreading   
OL,14,Feastwards Friday. Mostly dry and       
OL,15,Fcloudy on Saturday, then rain          
OL,16,Fovernight. Mostly dry with bright      
OL,17,Fspells on Sunday, showers in the west. 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
